- Duplicate connection listeners.
- Stale event handlers.
- Race conditions during reconnect.
- Reconnection while an old socket is still closing.
- Incorrect handling of connection.update.
- Incorrect handling of lastDisconnect.
- Unhandled promise rejections.
- Exceptions inside event callbacks.
